			}]
			title: "Occult Beginnings"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4479AB901F8621D9"]
			description: ["You've obtained some Demon's Dream. Good. Now we will want to &o&6combine it with a book&r and obtain &n&6The Dictionary of Spirits&r. This tome serves as both a guide and a tool for rituals."]
